cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Lost in Preparation"
abstract: >-
  Historical herbal recipes read as preparations: predicted compound profiles for each historical preparation, an
  audit of how modern studies prepared the same plants, and ranked hypotheses worth re-testing. Built for
  EthnoHack 2026, Track 1 (Traditional Knowledge Mining). Hypotheses worth re-testing, not medical claims.
type: software
